CORE
main.c
--unwind 2 --rounds 3 --allow-pointer-unsoundness
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Whichever thread calls pthread_once first runs the routine; the other waits
until it has returned. Before this model the call was an undefined function
and the routine never ran, so the assertions failed.
